evidence = "The final hf-done JSON and private /out/run/gates.jsonl identify the exact verified revision, command, exit code and log; build and verification must pass on the same candidate revision. This record is finalized before gates because inserting its own content-derived revision would change that revision. The runner retains qualification evidence and publishes the result; this task performs no manual commit or push."

